OL,3,GNEWSASketch released after alleged
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have released an artist's
OL,7,Fimpression of a man as part of an
OL,8,Finvestigation into what they describe
OL,9,Fas a serious sexual assault.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said a woman in
OL,12,Fher 20s was attacked in Mill Lane,
OL,13,FLittle Paxton, near St Neots, between
OL,14,F21:00 and 21:30 BST on 27 August.
OL,16,FThe suspect was described as being a
OL,17,Fwhite male with a pale complexion and
OL,18,Fshort dark hair. He was wearing a black
OL,19,FT-shirt, black shorts and white
OL,20,Ftrainers. Police said no arrests had
OL,21,Fbeen made.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
